Subject: [PATCH] Day 5: session taint tracking + prompt-injection scenario

- Gate marks the session tainted after read_web / read_inbox, before the content reaches the agent
- session_tainted on every session-bound audit event; clean->tainted transition logged as its own event
- Poisoned blog page with hidden exfil instruction; orchestrator 'inject' scenario ({sources} hand-off)
- scripts/demo_inject.ps1: scripted, LLM-free done check; GET /audit/events (admin)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
